cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the benchmark it builds, please cite the two companion papers."
title: "OmissionBench"
version: "v1.0.2"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/composo-ai/omission-bench"
url: "https://huggingface.co/datasets/ComposoAI/OmissionBench"
abstract: >-
  The harness behind two companion papers on whether automated judges detect that a
  clinical note has left something out: the benchmark's construction and verification
  pipeline, every prompt used to build, verify or judge any layer, the three
  prompt-optimisation campaigns with each candidate's full instruction text, the judge
  and pipeline runners, and the census instrument. The data is released separately under
  CC BY 4.0 at huggingface.co/datasets/ComposoAI/OmissionBench.
